# 保證跨平台一致的換行符
# Windows git 預設 core.autocrlf=true 會在 checkout 時把 LF 改成 CRLF,
# 但下面這些檔案在 WSL / Linux 容器內跑、CRLF 會直接壞掉:
#   - bash script: `set -euo pipefail\r` 被當成 invalid option
#   - Dockerfile: RUN 指令尾巴的 \r 進到 image 內、shell 解析 bug
#   - YAML: PyYAML 對 \r 容忍、但 docker-compose 嚴格時會炸

# 預設讓 git 自動判斷文字檔、但 checkout 統一 LF
* text=auto eol=lf

# 明確強制以下類型只能 LF(覆蓋 autocrlf=true)
*.sh         text eol=lf
*.bash       text eol=lf
Dockerfile   text eol=lf
*.dockerfile text eol=lf
*.yml        text eol=lf
*.yaml       text eol=lf

# Windows-only 檔案保留 CRLF(WSL 不會碰)
*.bat        text eol=crlf
*.cmd        text eol=crlf
*.ps1        text eol=crlf

# 二進位檔不要做任何 EOL 轉換
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.gif   binary
*.ico   binary
*.pdf   binary
*.zip   binary
*.gz    binary
*.tar   binary
*.xlsx  binary
*.docx  binary
*.pptx  binary
*.db    binary
*.sqlite binary
*.ttf   binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
